UPDATE companies SET description='Valcom Inc. was founded in 1977 in Roanoke, Virginia, where it remains headquartered. The company began with a focus on helping organizations communicate easily with their people, a mission that has evolved over more than four decades into a broader vision of keeping communities safe, informed, and on schedule.

Valcom designs and develops telecommunication systems, paging solutions, emergency notification platforms, and visual messaging solutions. All hardware is designed and assembled in-house, giving the company direct control over quality and the ability to pivot quickly. Proprietary software platforms such as VEMASS and VEEWS support system reliability and survivability. The company has deployed more than 44,000 K-12 communications systems, including for the Los Angeles Unified School District, the second-largest public school district in the United States.

Valcom serves K-12 and higher education, commercial and industrial facilities, healthcare, corporate campuses, transportation, government and military installations, and retail markets. Its solutions are engineered to integrate with existing infrastructure, and the company provides guidance on grant funding for emergency response upgrades. Customers include school districts, hospitals, and federal agencies.

The company emphasizes that its U.S.-based design and assembly, 24/7 technical support, and scalable architecture differentiate it from competitors. Valcom also allows customers to choose their own installers and integrators, and its grant assistance program helps organizations secure funding for safety improvements.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Telecommunication system design", "Paging system design", "Emergency notification system design", "Visual messaging system design", "Hardware design and assembly", "Software development (VEMASS, VEEWS)", "System integration", "Grant funding guidance", "24/7 technical support"], "industries": ["K-12 Education", "Higher Education", "Commercial/Industrial", "Healthcare", "Corporate", "Transportation", "Government & Military", "Retail"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All equipment designed and assembled in-house", "Exclusive software platforms VEMASS and VEEWS", "Engineered solutions integrate with existing infrastructure", "Scalable systems that can be expanded at any pace", "24/7 technical support"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1977 -> db", "Headquartered in Roanoke, Virginia -> db", "Designed and built in the USA since 1977 -> /", "24/7 support -> /", "All equipment designed and assembled in-house -> /", "Exclusive software VEMASS and VEEWS -> /", "Engineered solutions work with existing investments -> /", "Scalable solutions -> /", "Freedom to choose installer and integrator -> /", "Guidance on grant opportunities -> /", "Installed more than 44,000 K-12 communications systems -> /", "Los Angeles Unified School District (LAUSD) customer -> /", "Industries served: K-12, Higher Education, Commercial/Industrial, Healthcare, Corporate, Transportation, Government & Military, Retail -> /, /about-us", "Partnership with ILoveUGuys Foundation -> /", "Product lines: V-Guardian Alert Badge, PoE PowerHub, Bluetooth Beacon, LoRa Gateways, HeadEnds, Speakers, Horns, Visual Alerting, Clocks, Intercoms, HelpPoints, Gateways, Accessories -> /", "Regional sales map and support contacts -> /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "All equipment designed and assembled in house vs. outsourcing \u2013 this allows us to control quality and pivot on demand.", "founded_year": "1977", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='valcom-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Valentine Enterprises operates a 400,000-square-foot, company-owned facility in Lawrenceville, Georgia, where it provides contract manufacturing services for powder-based nutritional products.

The company’s core services span product development, ingredient sourcing, validated mixing, and precision packaging. Its formulators and scientists work with brands to create or refine powder supplements, including protein powders, vitamins, and nutritional blends. Manufacturing follows straight-line precision processes under cGMP and HACCP standards, with allergen-controlled protocols and rigorous cleaning procedures. The facility supports turnkey projects that manage development, sourcing, production, and quality assurance from concept to finished goods.

Valentine serves brands in the dietary supplement, sports nutrition, and wellness markets. Its client base includes Fortune 100 and Fortune 500 companies as well as large protein-powder sellers. The company emphasizes proprietary, customer-specific formulations rather than private-label offerings, though it notes it is exploring private-label solutions.

Valentine differentiates itself through a set of core values that prioritize personal quality ownership, ethical decision-making, rapid response times, and commitment adherence. It also highlights its certification portfolio—NSF, cGMP, Organic, Kosher, HACCP, and FDA registration—as evidence of going beyond industry standards. Flavor development is cited as a particular passion and specialty.', certifications=ARRAY['HACCP','cGMP','NSF','Organic','Kosher','FDA registration']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom powder formulation", "Blending", "Packaging", "Product development", "Ingredient sourcing", "Contract manufacturing", "Validated mixing services", "Precision packaging", "Allergen-controlled manufacturing", "Flavor development", "Turnkey project management", "Quality assurance (cGMP, HACCP)", "Regulatory compliance support"], "industries": ["Dietary supplements", "Sports nutrition", "Protein powders", "Nutritional manufacturing", "Wellness market", "Custom formulation"], "materials": ["Protein powders", "Vitamins", "Nutritional blends", "Allergenic ingredients"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "3 months for simpler formulations; several months for complex projects", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Company-owned 400,000 sqft facility", "Straight-line precision manufacturing", "Global supplier network for ingredient sourcing", "Allergen-controlled manufacturing with rigorous cleaning protocols", "Flavor development as a specialty", "Turnkey solutions from development to packaging", "Certifications: NSF, cGMP, Organic, Kosher, HACCP, FDA registered"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Lawrenceville, Georgia -> db", "Facility size: 400,000 sqft company-owned -> pages:/", "Services: custom powder formulation, blending, packaging, product development, sourcing -> pages:/", "Certifications: HACCP, cGMP, NSF, Organic, Kosher, FDA registration -> db, pages:/", "Manufacturing processes: straight-line precision, allergen-controlled, rigorous cleaning -> pages:/", "Industries served: dietary supplements, sports nutrition, protein powders, wellness -> pages:/", "Client examples: Fortune 100, Fortune 500, large protein powder sellers -> pages:/", "Lead time: ~3 months for simpler formulations, several months for complex -> pages:/", "Core values: quality personal, do right thing, fanatic response time, honor commitments -> pages:/", "Flavor development specialty -> pages:/", "Turnkey solutions from development to packaging -> pages:/", "Materials: protein powders, vitamins, nutritional blends, allergens -> pages:/"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Valentine is a leading contract manufacturer specializing in custom powder formulation, blending, packaging, and delivering science-backed solutions that bring products from concept to market.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='valentine-enterprises-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
