UPDATE companies SET description='Veterans Electric LLC, operating as Veteran''s Electric, is based in Lynchburg, Virginia.

The firm provides electrical contracting services across residential, commercial, and generator installation segments. Residential work includes wiring, lighting upgrades, panel repairs, and smart-home installations. Commercial services cover new installations, system upgrades, and ongoing maintenance for businesses and properties. The company also installs backup generators for homes and businesses.

Notable projects include the electrical build-out for the Americas Home Place showroom on Timberlake Road and new-construction wiring for homes on Meadowbrook Lane in Rustburg. The company''s background in industrial electrical work also positions it for light industrial clients.

