-> about-us", "End-to-end contract manufacturing for medical devices -> home", "Capabilities: precision metal tubing, extrusion, molding, micro-molding, machining, assembly -> home, services", "Clinical markets: orthopedics, surgical technology, cardiac & interventional, drug delivery, bioprocessing, bioelectronics, diagnostics, respiratory -> home", "Vertically integrated model with global facilities -> home, about-us", "ViaLaunch\u2122 program management -> home, services", "Materials: PEEK, LCP, UHMWPE, stainless steel, titanium, nitinol -> services", "Acquisition of Knightsbridge Plastics for micro-molding -> about-us", "Over 80 years of precision tube manufacturing -> services"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Viant is a medical device contract manufacturer providing end-to-end contract manufacturing for medical devices\u2014from design and development through precision manufacturing, sterile and non-sterile device assembly.", "founded_year": "1968", "employee_count": "nearly 7,000", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='viant' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Vico Plastic Molding operates from Janesville, Wisconsin, where it was founded in 2001 by William Gridley. The company began when Gridley, drawing on a background in manufacturing and sales, re‑engineered a struggling marine product into the Boat Vent II, which became a OEM and aftermarket boat cover.

It also offers warehousing, production planning and retail fulfillment through SPS Commerce. The facility handles low‑volume custom parts, small production runs and full‑scale production runs.

Customers span scientific instrumentation, prototyping, marine, medical, government and retail sectors. Retail clients use the company’s warehousing and small‑order fulfillment services.

