The firm specializes in both sales and rentals of heavy equipment, carrying a broad inventory that includes excavators, skid steers, tractors, trailers, dump trucks, front-end loaders, bulldozers, commercial trucks, commercial trailers, agricultural equipment, and construction attachments. This range allows it to supply machinery for earthmoving, material handling, and hauling applications.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Heavy equipment sales", "Heavy equipment rentals", "Commercial truck sales", "Commercial trailer sales", "Agricultural equipment sales", "Construction attachment sales"], "industries": ["Construction", "Agriculture", "Commercial transportation", "Equipment rental"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Excavators", "Skid steers", "Tractors", "Trailers", "Dump trucks", "Front-end loaders", "Bulldozers", "Commercial trucks", "Commercial trailers", "Agricultural equipment", "Construction attachments"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Location: Orange, Virginia -> db", "Founded: 1984 -> db, /", "Owner & Operator: Kent Higginbotham -> /", "Administration: Robert Higginbotham -> /", "Head of Sales: Hunter Hemp -> /", "Business: heavy equipment sales and rentals -> db, /", "Inventory categories: excavators, skid steers, tractors, trailers, dump trucks, front-end loaders, bulldozers, commercial trucks, commercial trailers, agricultural equipment, construction attachments -> /", "Industries served: construction, agriculture, commercial transportation -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "specializes in heavy equipment sales and rentals", "founded_year": "1984", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='virginia-equipment-distributors-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Virginia Industrial Plastics, Inc. (VIP) is a family-run plastic thermoforming and fabrication company based in Elkton, Virginia. For over 40 years it has provided contract manufacturing services from its plant there, producing made-in-the-USA parts for a range of industrial and commercial customers.

The company specializes in heavy-gauge thermoforming and vacuum forming, complemented by CNC trimming and CNC cutting from sheet stock. It builds its own tooling, molds, and fixtures, and offers value-added assembly, just-in-time inventory management, product design support, and material specification guidance. VIP also provides turnkey services that cover the full cycle from tooling through assembly, packaging, and shipping.

VIP serves markets including medical, commercial, transportation, construction, industrial, heavy equipment, and government sectors. Its parts are used in shipping containers for refrigerated food, construction equipment components, consumer products, home protection items, transportation parts, and various industrial applications.

