UPDATE companies SET description='Vishal Enterprises, Inc. is based in Northvale, New Jersey. Founded in 1989, the company is certified by the state as a Small Business Enterprise (SBE) and a Minority Business Enterprise (MBE). It began as a fashion industry service provider and has grown into a vertically integrated operation offering consulting, sourcing, and production management.

