UPDATE companies SET description='Vogue Furniture operates from Royal Oak, Michigan, where Greg founded the company in 1977 after discovering woodworking in a middle‑school shop. Sue handles finance and human resources as an owner, and the leadership team includes veterans such as Steve W., who has been with the firm since 1992, and Jim, who started as a teenage apprentice under Greg and now oversees more than 25 employees as general shop foreman.

Its capabilities span design, engineering, AutoCAD drafting, fabrication, finishing — including bleached, whitewashed, and wire‑brushed treatments — and on‑site installation. The shop handles everything from single pieces to whole‑home millwork packages, often integrating smart‑home features such as automated doors, motorized lifts, and custom lighting.

