UPDATE companies SET description='Wald Family Foods operates from McPherson, Kansas, where it has built a food manufacturing business over more than 25 years.

The company runs five food facilities equipped for private-label and custom manufacturing. Its capabilities span sauce production using a Graco Saniforce cold-blend mixing system and a 3-head Grote spot sauce applicator, kettle cooking for enchilada, burrito, and quesadilla fillings, spiral freezing, and a dual chill bath that drops product temperature below 55°F in under 50 minutes. A cold-press crust line produces 90–100 crusts per minute, supported by three production lines—two laminated sheeting lines and one doughball line. Wald Family Foods handles on-site test runs, full line production, and product fulfillment for soups, pasta, Mexican-style dishes, and other frozen items sold under its Taste Traditions brand.

Customers include national retailers such as Albertsons, ALDI, Costco, Hy-Vee, and distributors like Ben E. Keith, as well as brands like Bernatello''s, Conagra Brands, Nestlé, and Schwan''s.

Wald Family Foods emphasizes flexibility and brand integrity, promising never to put a label on a product that doesn''t represent the customer''s brand. Its Waldsafe program—"Safe People. Safe Facilities. Safe Food."—drives a company-wide safety culture. Community involvement includes sponsoring the Coaches vs. Cancer Las Vegas Golf Classic since 2021.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Food manufacturing", "Private label manufacturing", "Custom recipe development", "Custom packaging solutions", "Cold-blend sauce mixing (Graco Saniforce)", "Spot sauce application (3-head Grote)", "Kettle cooking (enchilada, burrito, quesadilla fillings)", "Spiral freezing", "Dual chill bath cooling (below 55\u00b0F in <50 minutes)", "Cold press crust production (90-100 crusts/min)", "Laminated sheeting", "Doughball production", "Test runs", "Line production", "Product fulfillment", "Retail and food service solutions (Taste Traditions brand)", "Safety program (Waldsafe)"], "industries": ["Food manufacturing", "Retail", "Food service", "Restaurant", "Broker", "Distributor", "Healthcare", "Education", "Hospitality", "Consumer", "Business & Industry", "Catering", "C-Store", "College & University", "Hospitals", "Long-Term Care", "K-12 Schools", "Lodging", "Military", "Vending"], "materials": ["Soup bases", "Mexican-style dish components", "Pasta", "Dough/crusts", "Sauces", "Fillings (enchilada, burrito, quesadilla)"], "equipment": ["Graco Saniforce cold-blend mixing system", "Spiral freezer (product cooling and processing)", "Dual chill bath (cools below 55\u00b0F in under 50 minutes)", "Kettles (enchilada, burrito, quesadilla filling production)", "Cold-blend mixing system with 3-head Grote spot sauce applicator", "Cold press crust production line (90-100 crusts per minute)", "Two laminated sheeting lines", "One doughball line"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Five food facilities with extensive manufacturing equipment and over 