UPDATE companies SET description='Walter Gordon Textiles Inc. was founded in 1960 and operates with sales offices in New York City and a warehouse and distribution center in Rock Hill, South Carolina.

The business functions as a wholesale distributor, focusing on woven fabrics. It manages inventory and logistics from its Rock Hill distribution center, handling both domestic and international shipments via truck and ocean freight.

