UPDATE companies SET description='Walton Plastics, Inc. operates from Walton Hills, Ohio, a suburb southeast of Cleveland. The company was founded in 1992 and has remained under family ownership since its inception, a structure the firm says keeps customer needs at the center of its decisions.

It runs three manufacturing facilities, the most recent added to expand capacity and secure supply chains. In-house capabilities include in-line lamination for acrylic cap layers, decorative films, and reinforcement fabrics, plus a physical testing laboratory that certifies color, impact resistance, and dimensional accuracy. Custom formulation development is offered for specialized applications.

Walton Plastics serves markets that include building products (wall panels, trim), electrical enclosures, printing and graphics substrates, thermoforming feedstock, and engineered materials for custom applications.

The firm emphasizes its family-owned culture as a driver of responsive service and technical competence. It points to plant-wide quality initiatives, advanced PVC production expertise, and the ability to laminate and test in-house as factors that differentiate it from competitors. The recent facility expansion was undertaken specifically to give customers added supply-chain assurance.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Rigid PVC extrusion", "Flexible PVC extrusion", "Polyurethane (TPU) extrusion", "In-line lamination (acrylic caps, decorative films, reinforcement fabrics)", "Custom formulation development", "Physical testing (color, impact, dimensional)"], "industries": ["Building products", "Electrical enclosures", "Printing and graphics", "Thermoforming", "Engineered materials"], "materials": ["Rigid PVC", "Flexible PVC", "Polyurethane (TPU)", "Acrylic", "Decorative films", "Reinforcement fabrics"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned structure maintained since 1992", "Third manufacturing facility added for supply-chain security", "In-line lamination for acrylic caps, decorative films, and reinforcement layers", "On-site physical testing laboratory for color, impact, and dimensional certification", "Custom formulation development for specialized PVC and polyurethane applications"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1992 -> db, /about", "Headquarters Walton Hills, Ohio -> db, /about", "Family-owned since inception -> /about", "Three manufacturing facilities, third added recently -> /about", "Produces rigid PVC, flexible PVC, and TPU sheets -> /quality", "In-line lamination capabilities for acrylic caps, decorative films, reinforcement fabrics -> /about", "Physical testing laboratory for color, impact, dimensional properties -> /about", "Custom formulation development offered -> /about", "Serves building products, electrical enclosures, printing/graphics, thermoforming, engineered materials ->