UPDATE companies SET description='Welton Technology LLC was founded in 2018 in Leominster, Massachusetts.

The company provides an enterprise-grade technology platform that combines AI and machine learning, cloud infrastructure, API gateway and mesh, data and analytics, security and compliance, and CI/CD and DevOps tooling. The platform runs on a global network of more than 320 points of presence, delivers a 99.9% uptime SLA with sub-10-millisecond average latency, and has powered over 40,000 products across 90 countries since launch. Capabilities include fine-tunable foundation models, vector databases, RAG pipelines, real-time inference APIs, autoscaling compute, managed Kubernetes, global CDN, Terraform-native infrastructure as code, rate limiting, JWT authentication, GraphQL federation, Kafka-compatible streaming, lakehouse architecture, automated vulnerability scanning, SAST/DAST integration, secret management, GitOps workflows, blue-green deployments, and feature flags with rollback in seconds.

Welton serves engineering teams in regulated and high-growth sectors, including fintech, healthcare SaaS, e-commerce, and developer tools. Reference customers cited on the site include a Series C fintech in San Francisco, a healthcare SaaS platform in London, an e-commerce enterprise in Amsterdam, and a developer-tools startup in Berlin.

The company positions its platform as invisible infrastructure that lets teams deploy AI into production in hours rather than months, unify multi-cloud environments under a single control plane, and achieve zero-trust security without sacrificing deployment speed. Its stated aim is to deliver reliability at any scale for developers, data teams, and enterprise operators who refuse to compromise on speed, security, or scalability.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 27001','SOC 2']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["AI & Machine Learning: fine-tunable foundation models, vector databases, RAG pipelines, real-time inference APIs", "Cloud Infrastructure: autoscaling compute, managed Kubernetes, global CDN, Terraform-native IaC", "API Gateway & Mesh: rate limiting, JWT auth, GraphQL federation, full observability", "Data & Analytics: real-time streaming with Kafka-compatible connectors, lakehouse architecture, SQL-first analytics", "Security & Compliance: automated vulnerability scanning, SAST/DAST integration, secret management, continuous compliance monitoring", "CI/CD & DevOps: GitOps workflows, blue-green deployments, feature flags, rollback in seconds"], "industries": ["Fintech", "Healthcare SaaS", "E-commerce", "Developer Tools", "Regulated Industries"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["99.9% uptime SLA with sub-10ms average latency", "Global network of 320+ points of presence", "SOC 2 and ISO 27001 certified, GDPR and HIPAA ready", "Unified control plane across AWS, GCP, and Azure", "AI deployment in hours, not months; GitOps rollback in seconds"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2018 -> db", "Headquarters Leominster, Massachusetts -> db", "Employee count 280 -> db", "ISO 27001 certification -> db", "Team of 280+ engineers, researchers, product designers -> /", "Platform powered 40,000+ products across 90 countries since 2018 -> /", "99.9% uptime SLA -> /", "10ms average latency -> /", "320+ global edge nodes -> /",