UPDATE companies SET description='Wesdon Automotive, a division of Wesdon Industries LLC, has operated from West Bend, Wisconsin since 2004. The company was established to supply premium exhaust components for a wide range of vehicles, though the founders are not publicly named. Ownership details beyond the LLC structure are not disclosed.

