ems, systems integration -> /services", "Industries served: Energy & Utilities -> db", "Automation and material handling industry mentioned -> /services", "Partners: Westinghouse control products distributor, Chromalox distributor, IBM authorized distributor product integrator -> /about", "Team members: Jerry Karr (President), Richard Haley, Kevin Poling, Kevin Pyles, Jason Hanshaw -> /about", "Custom solutions, not off-the-shelf -> /about", "Over 50 PLC system installations since 1979 -> /about"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "WV Electric is a full service industrial electrical engineering, programming, installation and service company", "founded_year": "1946", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='west-virginia-electric-corporation' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
